280-- AC-037 (FR-014, §13): The banner is announced via a polite live region, item states have text labels, and the 
sign-out dialog and mention list are fully keyboard-operable.
281-- AC-038 (FR-002, FR-006, BR-004): Given A's create request is stored but its response is dropped, then the item 
