within 15 s (plus request time) of being sent once polling is active.
30:- With healthy connectivity and Realtime, cross-device/tab sync of unread counts, read state, and own sent messages 
within 5 s (D4); during a Realtime outage the polling deadlines above apply.
54:- Application-level recovery, health, and catch-up for every messaging Realtime stream 
